@translation unitary en project
@unit 1
@span 1 - 6
Gudea, ruler of Lagaš, who built the temple of Ninŋešzida and the temple of Ŋeštin-ana.

@unit 2
@span  i 1 - iii 4
For Ŋeštin-ana, the lady ..., the beloved spouse of Ninŋešzida, his lady, Gudea, ruler of Lagaš, built her temple in Ŋirsu. He fashioned his statue, named it for her sake "She stands by the entreaties", and brought it before her into the temple.




